      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The early 1900s oil boom reshaped Ossun’s rural economy, drawing workers and new businesses to the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/ossun_louisiana",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Local zydeco and Cajun bands, like Kevin Naquin and the Ossun Playboys, blend traditional two‑steps with modern flair.",
